      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_9",
        on: "branch_if_9",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "get_gryphons",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Not her again! We must hurry! Do not forget to bring the gryphon eggs. They must be allowed more time to hatch. Quickly!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_10",
        on: "branch_if_10",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "get_gryphons",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Not her again! Quickly! We must hurry!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("This is the Ford of Abez. When we ford this river, we will be leaving Wesnoth, and entering the lands of the North. The dwarves once ruled these lands, but they are now filled only with chaos. This is where your father and uncle were betrayed, almost twenty-one years ago now, Konrad."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Really? So what happened, Delfador?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The forces of the King were encamped here, and the forces of the north were on the north side of the river. For three days and three nights the armies faced each other, neither willing to ford the river. On the fourth day, the northern armies crossed and attacked us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("And then... we were defeated?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We were winning the battle. We were repelling them..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("And then the King’s son, in the heat of battle, turned upon the King!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("But you avenged the murder. You killed the Prince. Right, Delfador?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("When I saw the King betrayed and his banner fallen, I fled the battle. I know not now whether it was wisdom or cowardice, but I did flee, seeing no further hope on that day."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Oh, but the elves always told me that you killed the Prince, Delfador, even though you never talked about it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("That foolish boy killed himself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("What do you mean?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I mustered men to fight against the traitor-king, and of course Asheviere too, for she was behind it all. We met them; not here, but on the road from Weldyn, at Tath. We were outnumbered, perhaps four to one. In the heat of battle, that boy, fool that he was, came charging at me, slashing wildly. I had little choice but to end his life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("So it is true, you did kill him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("He did die in battle at my hand. It is sad that your brothers did not have the opportunity to experience such an honorable death, Konrad."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("With all respect, my lords, we must make haste. We have to ford the river immediately. And, look! It seems that the guard-towers on the river banks are manned!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gaga-Breuk",
            text: _("Look! Some of the southerners, men of Wesnoth, are trying to cross into our lands! We will slaughter them by the river’s edge!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Isn’t there somewhere else we can cross? Maybe upstream?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Winter quickly bears down upon us. We have only a few days to make the crossing, and the nearest bridge is far upstream. To be trapped south of the river when winter arrives would be suicide. Asheviere would have us trapped like rats! Look to the west! Asheviere has a border fort, and it seems to be full of soldiers! We must cross here, and quickly!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-mad.webp",
            text: _("There they are! So it is true, they foiled the undead. Now they are trying to leave Wesnoth. We can’t let them cross the river. After them, men!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_10",
          },
        ],
      },
